# Cloudflare Pages headers (also honoured by Netlify).
# Enable cross-origin isolation so the app can share a SharedArrayBuffer across
# worker realms (the coordinated I/O budget, WASM threads, etc.). This requires
# every cross-origin subresource to carry CORP — the editor's fonts are vendored
# same-origin under /fonts/ and icons are inlined into the bundle, so there are
# no cross-origin subresources to break.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp

# Hashed, immutable build assets — cache aggressively.
/_nuxt/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
